ee root when `direct` mode. `session.json.git.worktreePath` is the durable field that row 6 stamps from this in-turn value; from row 6 onward `session.json.git.worktreePath` is the canonical reference — per `git/SKILL.md` § [Memory Access Matrix](../git/SKILL.md#memory-access-matrix) (Critical rule — write paths) and `d-2-qualified-git-rule.md`. | [`git/SKILL.md` § P2](../git/SKILL.md#p2----create-worktree), [`git/SKILL.md` § P6](../git/SKILL.md#p6----recover-orphaned-worktree), [`git/conventions.md` :22 (shape regex)](../git/conventions.md#branch-naming), [`git/conventions.md` :64 (length)](../git/conventions.md#branch-naming) | manager |
