     1	# AGENTS.md
     2	
     3	Gobbi is an open-source ClaudeX (Claude Experience) tool. In this repository, Gobbi is exposed to Codex through the official repo-local Codex paths:
     4	
     5	- Skills: `.agents/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`
     6	- Custom agents: `.codex/agents/<role>.toml`
     7	- Plugin manifest: `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`
     8	- Plugin skills: `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`
     9	- Canonical Gobbi sources: `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/` and `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/`
    10	
    11	MUST read this at session start, resume, `/clear`, and compaction. MUST follow the core principles below. MUST load Gobbi skills from `.agents/skills`, not user-level skill locations.
    12	
    13	The repo also exposes Gobbi as a local Codex plugin. The plugin root is the repository root, and `.agents/plugins/marketplace.json` points to `./`. The plugin manifest's `skills` field points directly at `./.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/`, the same source-of-truth skill tree used by `.agents/skills`.
    14	
    15	---
    16	
    17	## Codex Entry Points
    18	
    19	`.agents/skills` contains symlinked skill folders pointing to `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/`.
    20	
    21	`.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills` is also the plugin-facing skills directory because `.codex-plugin/plugin.json` points its `skills` field there.
    22	
    23	`.codex-plugin/plugin.json` is the Gobbi plugin manifest for local plugin installation from this workspace.
    24	
    25	`.codex/agents` contains symlinked TOML custom-agent wrappers pointing to `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/*.toml`. Each wrapper instructs the spawned Codex agent to read the corresponding canonical Markdown role prompt in the same directory.
    26	
    27	Available role prompts:
    28	
    29	| Custom agent | Codex wrapper | Canonical prompt |
    30	|--------------|---------------|------------------|
    31	| `manager` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/manager.toml` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/manager.md` |
    32	| `leader` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/leader.toml` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/leader.md` |
    33	| `executor` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/executor.toml` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/executor.md` |
    34	| `evaluator` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/evaluator.toml` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/evaluator.md` |
    35	| `assistant` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/assistant.toml` | `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/agents/assistant.md` |

